sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Learner as Learner Client
    participant WS as WebSocket Manager (/ws/{id})
    participant Redis as Redis 7 Pub/Sub
    actor Mentor as Mentor Client
    participant Jitsi as Jitsi Meet Server

    Learner->>WS: Connect WebSocket (Bearer JWT auth)
    WS->>Redis: SET session:presence:{session_id}:{user_id} (TTL: 60s)
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH channel:session:{session_id} (event="USER_JOINED")
    Redis-->>Mentor: Receive "USER_JOINED" notification via WebSocket
    
    Mentor->>WS: Connect WebSocket (Bearer JWT auth)
    WS->>Redis: SET session:presence:{session_id}:{user_id} (TTL: 60s)
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH channel:session:{session_id} (event="USER_JOINED")
    Redis-->>Learner: Receive "USER_JOINED" notification

    Note over Learner,Mentor: Both clients load embedded Jitsi Meet IFrame with secure room token
    Learner->>Jitsi: Join Video/Audio Room
    Mentor->>Jitsi: Join Video/Audio Room

    loop Collaborative Notes & Action Items
        Learner->>WS: Send note/topic creation event
        WS->>Redis: PUBLISH channel:session:{session_id} (event="NOTE_CREATED")
        Redis-->>Mentor: Instant sync note to Mentor workspace
    end

    Learner->>WS: Disconnect / Leave
    WS->>Redis: DEL session:presence:{session_id}:{user_id}
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH channel:session:{session_id} (event="USER_LEFT")
    Redis-->>Mentor: Display participant offline status
